// all aliasees are private anonymous values. E.g.
//  @a = alias i8, i8 *@g
//  @g = global i8 0
//
// will be converted to:
//  @0 = private global
//  @a = alias i8, i8* @0
//  @g = alias i8, i8* @0
//
// This simplifies optimization and ThinLTO linking of the original symbols.
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//

